// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
#include <ansi.h>
mapping *quest = ({
     ([      "quest":                "易筋经文学篇",
                "diff":                 3,
        ]),
        ([      "quest":                "草莓",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
        ([      "quest":                "指套",
                "diff":                 1,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "哈密瓜",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "兔肉",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                "柴",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
     ([      "quest":                HIY "冬不拉" NOR,
                "diff":                 5,
        ]),
        ([      "quest":                "花雕酒袋",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
        ([      "quest":                "烤鸭",
                "diff":                 2,
        ]),
        ([      "quest":                "麻布袋",
                "diff":                 1,
        ]),
});
mapping query_quest()
{
        return quest[random(sizeof(quest))];
}
